{"turn": 15, "content": "T1 is at L2a and T5 will reach L2b first. I\u2019ll shorten T1\u2019s route to L3a for another brief wait, preventing it from entering S3 ahead of T5. The other trains can continue following their current orders.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "step_13", "index": 0, "type": "function", "function": {"name": "step", "arguments": "{\"commands\": [{\"train\": \"T1\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L2a\", \"S3\", \"L3a\"]}], \"expected_decision_id\": 11, \"request_id\": \"t1-yield-t5\"}"}}]}
{"turn": 16, "content": "T1 and T5 have deadlocked on S3. I\u2019ll keep the remaining eight trains moving by using L3b for the eastbound convoy; T2 and T8 are already clear of that route.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "step_14", "index": 0, "type": "function", "function": {"name": "step", "arguments": "{\"commands\": [{\"train\": \"T3\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L2a\", \"S3\", \"L3b\", \"S4\", \"E_arr\"]}, {\"train\": \"T4\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L2a\", \"S3\", \"L3b\", \"S4\", \"E_arr\"]}, {\"train\": \"T6\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"S2\", \"L2a\", \"S3\", \"L3b\", \"S4\", \"E_arr\"]}, {\"train\": \"T7\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"S2\", \"L2a\", \"S3\", \"L3b\", \"S4\", \"E_arr\"]}, {\"train\": \"T9\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L1a\", \"S2\", \"L2a\", \"S3\", \"L3b\", \"S4\", \"E_arr\"]}, {\"train\": \"T10\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L1a\", \"S2\", \"L2a\", \"S3\", \"L3b\", \"S4\", \"E_arr\"]}], \"expected_decision_id\": 12, \"request_id\": \"bypass-s3-deadlock\"}"}}]}
{"turn": 17, "content": "S3 is now impassable, so trains east of it cannot reach the western terminus and trains west of it cannot reach the eastern terminus. I\u2019ll stop the approaching trains short of S3 to prevent further deadlocks and check whether T2 can still be released through L2.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "step_15", "index": 0, "type": "function", "function": {"name": "step", "arguments": "{\"commands\": [{\"train\": \"T4\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L2a\"]}, {\"train\": \"T6\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"S2\", \"L2a\"]}, {\"train\": \"T7\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"S2\", \"L2a\"]}, {\"train\": \"T9\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L1a\"]}, {\"train\": \"T10\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L1a\"]}], \"expected_decision_id\": 13, \"request_id\": \"contain-deadlock\"}"}}]}
{"turn": 18, "content": "T2 and T8 are still clear of the blocked section. I\u2019ll advance T2 through L2b and S2 to L1b, keeping it on the long loop while the eastbound trains remain stopped on L1a.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "step_16", "index": 0, "type": "function", "function": {"name": "step", "arguments": "{\"commands\": [{\"train\": \"T2\", \"action\": \"route\", \"route\": [\"L2b\", \"S2\", \"L1b\"]}], \"expected_decision_id\": 14, \"request_id\": \"t2-advance-l1b\"}"}}]}
